ia. </p>", "short_description": "Missiles are incoming. The stakes are high. Only you can stop the destruction. Manage your pool of defenses strategically to survive rounds of incoming missiles in this high-pressure, tactical turn-based game. Will you be able to unravel the mystery in time?", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790160/4649496b410287001ad7a7c8f2e05b9a98a73e9b/header.jpg?t=1752010072", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790160/cd785402ef4737b6d39aef14a616229ef7c8f4af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752010072", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790160/cd785402ef4737b6d39aef14a616229ef7c8f4af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752010072", "website": "https://atari.com/products/missile-command-delta", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Quad CPU Q8200 @ 2.33GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon HD 5700 Series or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 1980-2025 Atari Interactive, Inc. ATARI and the ATARI logo are trademarks of At